{
  "$comment": "Every Pact Broker write: the pacts permission it needs, and the access_audit action it writes (PFX-6.1, #6953). auditedBy: 'route' rows are wrapped in app.pact_audit.audited_write (row written after the change); 'transaction' rows append the row inside the change's own transaction (app.pact_cleanup_store.audit_tx); 'explicit' rows call app.pact_audit.record_pact_write. 'reads' are POST routes that change nothing and write no row. Routes under /pact-broker answered by pact_broker_compat_routes.pact_broker_not_implemented (501) change nothing. Checked by apiome-rest/tests/test_pacts_permission_matrix.py; the grants are apiome.seed_builtin_roles (V432).",
